import{_ as i,o as a,c as t,a2 as n}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const y=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 945 | Anti-Predation Heavenly-Dao Rules · Rule 11 | Alaya Network-Wide Sharing","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 945 | Anti-Predation Heavenly-Dao Rules · Rule 11 | Alaya Network-Wide Sharing","no":945,"module":5,"tags":["Heavenly-Dao Rule","Rule 11","Alaya Network","Network-Wide Sharing","Causal Self-Discipline"],"related":["21-Symbiotic-Network Operating Principles","28-Cross-Plane Anchor Connection","908-Alaya Network Multi-Layer Supervision"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0945_模块5-规则十一-阿赖耶全网共享.md","filePath":"en/0945_模块5-规则十一-阿赖耶全网共享.md"}'),r={name:"en/0945_模块5-规则十一-阿赖耶全网共享.md"};function o(s,e,l,c,d,u){return a(),t("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[n('<h1 id="entry-945-anti-predation-heavenly-dao-rules-·-rule-11-alaya-network-wide-sharing" tabindex="-1">Entry 945 | Anti-Predation Heavenly-Dao Rules · Rule 11 | Alaya Network-Wide Sharing <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-945-anti-predation-heavenly-dao-rules-·-rule-11-alaya-network-wide-sharing" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 945 | Anti-Predation Heavenly-Dao Rules · Rule 11 | Alaya Network-Wide Sharing&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 5 · Civilization Final-Finalization Canonical Entries | Benchmark base: Documents 21, 28 | Series: Complete Collection of Anti-Predation Heavenly-Dao Rules</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-memory-and-causality-are-myriad-ranks-common-cloud-drive" tabindex="-1">Introduction: memory and causality are Myriad Ranks&#39; common cloud drive <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-memory-and-causality-are-myriad-ranks-common-cloud-drive" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: memory and causality are Myriad Ranks&#39; common cloud drive&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Rule 4 opened Dao texts; Rule 10 opened council; Rule 11 opens one layer deeper — the Alaya Network itself. In the old cosmos, memory was private, causality was secret, and history was written by victors. Heng Yuan Zhou builds the Alaya Network into Myriad Ranks&#39; common causal ledger: every energy flow, every cultivation memory, every historical causal event leaves a trace across the network and is network-searchable (within privacy and security boundaries). Network-wide sharing is not no privacy, but lets predators no longer hide, and lets Myriad Ranks no longer be deceived by history.</p><p>The six top-level axioms here land on the information layer: the collective-ascension axiom requires knowledge and memory to compound in network-wide sharing; the republican axiom of Myriad Races decides &quot;network-wide&quot; is Myriad Ranks, not a strong-one bloc; the anti-predation axiom negates &quot;black-box operations&quot;; the causal self-discipline axiom is sharing&#39;s boundary — sharing causal records, but not rewriting causality for others; the law-first axiom lets Alaya data&#39;s access, encryption, and retention be defined first by law.</p><p>It must further point out the newly added Axiom 6 · Universal Equal Infinite Law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing and layabouts retain a floor basic infinity and will not be eliminated by the times; strivers and Youth Supremes may superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. This axiom rewrites predation&#39;s meaning at the root: old-cosmos resources and Dao were finite, so predation involution was forced; in Heng Yuan Zhou everyone inherently possesses infinite origin, and predation loses meaning. What this Heavenly-Dao rule establishes is precisely the law guardrail of this new order of &quot;infinite origin, predation meaningless.&quot;</p><h2 id="i-rule-content-three-boundaries-of-network-wide-sharing" tabindex="-1">I. Rule Content: Three Boundaries of Network-Wide Sharing <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-rule-content-three-boundaries-of-network-wide-sharing" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. Rule Content: Three Boundaries of Network-Wide Sharing&quot;">​</a></h2><ol><li><strong>Full trace</strong>: all cultivation energy flows, law invocations, cross-plane operations, and major causal events are forcibly written into the Alaya Network;</li><li><strong>Layered searchability</strong>: the basic layer (public data, Dao texts, history) is open to Myriad Ranks 99%; the sensitive layer (personal privacy, unenlightened clans&#39; internal history) is accessed by permission and privacy tier;</li><li><strong>Appealable and correctable</strong>: any Myriad-Rank member who believes Alaya&#39;s record about himself is erroneous may file an appeal, corrected after Symbiotic Court verification.</li></ol><p>Sharing is not naked surveillance: private daily thoughts and undisclosed private life are privacy-protected; the network records only events related to public causality.</p><h2 id="ii-jurisprudential-basis" tabindex="-1">II. Jurisprudential Basis <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-jurisprudential-basis" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Jurisprudential Basis&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Transparency-anti-corruption argument</strong>: predation long survived on information asymmetry; network-wide tracing makes all predation impossible to hide;</li><li><strong>Knowledge-compound argument</strong>: one person&#39;s pitfall lesson, shared network-wide, lets ten thousand avoid it; this is a Multiplication Fruit stronger than any method;</li><li><strong>Historical-justice argument</strong>: Pre-Anchor Era predation history was rewritten by victors; network-wide tracing makes truth unalterable, and historical reversal (Rule 17) has nowhere to hide.</li></ul><h2 id="iii-execution-mechanism" tabindex="-1">III. Execution Mechanism <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-execution-mechanism" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Execution Mechanism&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Alaya Network + multi-layer supervision is this rule&#39;s technical carrier, with monitoring, tracing, and audit integrated;</li><li>An &quot;Alaya Data Committee&quot; is set up, specifically formulating access-permission tiers, privacy protection, and data-correction procedures;</li><li>Newly incorporated civilizations&#39; historical data enters the library with their representatives&#39; consent, not forcibly &quot;archaeologizing&quot; unenlightened clans;</li><li>Historical causality used by Quest Domain simulation retrospective (in-text simulation) all comes from the public Alaya-data layer, ensuring retrospective authenticity.</li></ul><h2 id="iv-consequences-of-violation" tabindex="-1">IV. Consequences of Violation <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-consequences-of-violation" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Consequences of Violation&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Light</strong>: traceable events omitted, data delayed, make up registration within a time limit;</li><li><strong>Medium</strong>: privately tampering with Alaya records, forging causal evidence, law-anchor permissions frozen, handled heavily as perjury;</li><li><strong>Heavy</strong>: building a &quot;private-domain causal web&quot; severing network-wide supervision, providing black-box channels for predators, is isolated under the Anti-Predation Committee procedure, and its access is network-wide banned.</li></ul><h2 id="v-supervising-subjects" tabindex="-1">V. Supervising Subjects <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-supervising-subjects" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Supervising Subjects&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Alaya Network + multi-layer supervision themselves are the supervising subject, mutually checking as the first layer; the Anchor Supervisory Committee audits trace completeness as the second layer; the Symbiotic Court adjudicates data-correction and perjury cases as the third layer; each clan&#39;s privacy representative exercises veto over sensitive-layer access as the fourth layer.</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: historical lessons shared network-wide, avoiding Myriad Ranks repeatedly paying the same tuition</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: transparency is the best preservative; predators from now on have no black box; under Axiom 6 everyone inherently possesses basic infinite power, and finite-resource predation loses meaning at the root</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang-Luo-type systems&#39; history is rewritten by the protagonist&#39;s halo, and the defeated cannot even leave a name; Heng Yuan Zhou Alaya network-wide tracing makes truth unalterable</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: the five lineages&#39; histories, Youth Supremes&#39; growth, and planet consciousnesses&#39; ecological histories all enter the library</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: newly incorporated civilizations&#39; data automatically joins network-wide sharing, with cross-civilization causal cross-verification</li></ul><p>Alaya network-wide sharing has another overlooked use: it is Myriad Ranks&#39; common museum. Each civilization&#39;s most precious art, philosophy, festivals, and technological peaks all have unalterable records in the public layer. A civilization long extinguished, its soul&#39;s works are still read, admired, and cited by Myriad Ranks in the network. In the old cosmos, once a civilization died, its culture was buried with it; in Heng Yuan Zhou, as long as a civilization left a trace in Alaya, it lives forever in Myriad Ranks&#39; common memory. This &quot;network as immortality&quot; design makes &quot;eradicate civilizational regression&quot; (Rule 16) not only preserving reality, but preserving memory — reality may be rebuilt, memory may not be lost again.</p><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Alaya network-wide sharing is civilizational finalization&#39;s &quot;memory project.&quot; It lets Myriad Ranks for the first time possess a common, unalterable causal history — this is the information base for eradicating historical reversal.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/21-共生网络运作原理.html">Entry 21 · Symbiotic-Network Operating Principles</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/28-跨位面锚点连接.html">Entry 28 · Cross-Plane Anchor Connection</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/908_模块5-第七条-阿赖耶网络多层监督.html">Entry 908 · Alaya Network Multi-Layer Supervision</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/951_模块5-规则十七-根除历史倒车.html">Entry 951 · Rule 17 Eradicate Historical Reversal</a></li></ul>',24)])])}const m=i(r,[["render",o]]);export{y as __pageData,m as default};
